<title>USA: U.S. brass mill inventories dip in March - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. brass mill inventories dip in March - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. brass mill inventories fell to 143,755 short tons (copper content) at the end of March from 144,729 short tons in February, the American Bureau of Metal Statistics said.</p>
<p>Total brass mill shipments rose to 159,721 short tons from a revised total of 144,975 short tons in February. Total receipts were 92,613 short tons in March, up from February's 88,021 short tons.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
